{"content":[{"c":["HOBAB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Name associated with Moses’ father-in-law (",{"href":"?bref=Num.10.29","r":"Num.10.29","rawR":"Num.10.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.10.29","value":"Num.10.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 10:29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.11","r":"Judg.4.11","rawR":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.11","value":"Judg.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 4:11"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg), who was a priest of Midian (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.18.1","r":"Exod.18.1","rawR":"Exod.18.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.18.1","value":"Exod.18.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 18:1"},") and ancestor of the Kenites (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.11","r":"Judg.4.11","rawR":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.11","value":"Judg.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 4:11"},"). He is usually called Jethro (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.3.1","r":"Exod.3.1","rawR":"Exod.3.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.3.1","value":"Exod.3.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 3:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.4.18","r":"Exod.4.18","rawR":"Exod.4.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.4.18","value":"Exod.4.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.18.1-12","r":"Exod.18.1-12","rawR":"Exod.18.1-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.18.1-12","value":"Exod.18.1-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"18:1-12"},"), but also Reuel (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.2.18","r":"Exod.2.18","rawR":"Exod.2.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.2.18","value":"Exod.2.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 2:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["The confusion surrounding the name Hobab has never been satisfactorily resolved. ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.11","r":"Judg.4.11","rawR":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.11","value":"Judg.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 4:11"}," seems to identify Hobab with Jethro; there is some manuscript evidence for adding “Hobab” to “the Kenite, Moses’ father-in-law” in ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.16","r":"Judg.1.16","rawR":"Judg.1.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.16","value":"Judg.1.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 1:16"},", and to the mention of Reuel in ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.2.18","r":"Exod.2.18","rawR":"Exod.2.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.2.18","value":"Exod.2.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Exodus 2:18"},". But Hobab could be Jethro’s son, on one reading of ",{"href":"?bref=Num.10.29","r":"Num.10.29","rawR":"Num.10.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.10.29","value":"Num.10.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Numbers 10:29a"},": “Hobab the son of Reuel the Midianite, Moses’ father-in-law.” In this passage Moses requests that Hobab accompany Israel as guide and adviser in the wilderness."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Jethro_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Jethro_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Jethro_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Jethro"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hobab","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 10:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.10.29","rawQueryValue":"Num.10.29","sourceRefExact":"Num.10.29"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.11"},{"anchorText":"Ex 18:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.18.1","rawQueryValue":"Exod.18.1","sourceRefExact":"Exod.18.1"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.11"},{"anchorText":"Ex 3:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.3.1","rawQueryValue":"Exod.3.1","sourceRefExact":"Exod.3.1"},{"anchorText":"4:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.4.18","rawQueryValue":"Exod.4.18","sourceRefExact":"Exod.4.18"},{"anchorText":"18:1-12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.18.1-12","rawQueryValue":"Exod.18.1-12","sourceRefExact":"Exod.18.1-12"},{"anchorText":"Ex 2:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.2.18","rawQueryValue":"Exod.2.18","sourceRefExact":"Exod.2.18"},{"anchorText":"Judges 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.11"},{"anchorText":"Judges 1:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.1.16","rawQueryValue":"Judg.1.16","sourceRefExact":"Judg.1.16"},{"anchorText":"Exodus 2:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.2.18","rawQueryValue":"Exod.2.18","sourceRefExact":"Exod.2.18"},{"anchorText":"Numbers 10:29a","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.10.29","rawQueryValue":"Num.10.29","sourceRefExact":"Num.10.29"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"df1d166b7390a844eb8085c5fdc0ae5328e92ecd7da84b1acd0f4dbb11755c82","sourceItemName":"Hobab","sourceItemOrder":312,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hobab","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hobab","title":"Hobab","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}